Generated artefacts are written here by `python agent_runner.py`:

  generated_investor_report.json   the frontend contract (validated against
                                   config/output_schema.json on every run)
  reporting_assistant.html         standalone reporting-assistant screen
  generated_commentary.md          the full review pack
  generated_commentary.pdf         printable board pack

Nothing here is committed. The figures come from sample_data/, so a stale file
checked into the repo would be mistaken for the current quarter.
